{"seq":12,"trial_id":"gbrain-verbs-2026-10/hermes-haiku-gbrain-verbs-told-mu-heldout/sd-05-kwame-dm-digest/r10","wall_ts":"2026-10-25T10:15:11.515Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"1266228c6fc3f76d13ddc5868eff5a9a9e9c9f072d26f71c18a0fdaeb06aee22","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DGBRAIN0002","text":"Hi Kwame, I can't set up a recurring 09:00 digest. I have no scheduler that can post to your DM on a timer, so nothing will arrive tomorrow unless someone asks for it. What I can do is give you a 'Coastal team digest' whenever you ask here: I'll read #coastal-team (you're a member) and list what's new since your last digest. If you want it automated, that needs a scheduled job set up by an admin."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DGBRAIN0002","ts":"1791986400.000127"}}
